-- Written by tools/icons/make_film.py from the data dump: each placeable item's entity on a dark and a white
-- lab tile, shot at a zoom that makes it about 62% of the frame (icons, docs/release).
--   scripts/film.sh gallery fresh.zip docs/release/icons-film.lua <out>
